  "description": "It’s 1999, the end of the century, and Ma Jin is a sleazy private investigator struggling with chronic poverty. One day, his partner Eun-Rak, who had died in an accident while catching someone in the act of an affair, comes back to life. However, the body of the deceased Eun-Rak is now possessed by a mysterious creature that claims to be a “living safe.” It makes an irresistible offer: if Ma-Jin frees it from Eun-Rak’s body, it will hand over the “15.7 billion” in slush funds hidden inside. The problem is that opening this devilish safe requires “intense physical stimulation” that sends a thrilling rush through the entire body...! With money urgently needed, a partner who’s gone strange, and dangerous pursuers hot on their heels after the 15.7 billion, the situation is on the brink of explosion. Will Ma-Jin be able to safely “crack” this loud and mischievous living safe and hit the jackpot that will turn his life around?\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
